# Identifiers belonging to the organisation the system was deployed at.
# Not secrets -- which is why no credential scanner looks for them, and why an
# extracted internal project leaks them by accident. One line per regex.
# Read by `make scan`, the CI secrets job, and tests/unit/test_no_internal_identifiers.py.
# This file is the only place they are allowed to appear.
undrr
unisdr
un\.org
preventionweb
10\.210\.
mx-westeurope
openai\.azure\.com
